WEBVTT


00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:02.153
Greetings


00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:05.131
As a boy I was always
interested in the abnormal.


00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:09.093
I liked to imagine


00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:12.104
the history of each scar and imperfection.


00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:18.068
When touching the scars


00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:19.204
I felt that there was a story


00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:22.181
beneath every wound.


00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:31.023
A small abnormality to me


00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:35.223
was something to contemplate.


00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:06.217
What is this?


00:02:06.226 --> 00:02:08.126
Why are you all here?


00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:11.130
Calm down, calm down...


00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:14.934
This is my territory


00:02:15.068 --> 00:02:17.002
If we settle,


00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:19.937
it means no more Yakuza
trespassing into this area.


00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:22.100
They say this is their turf.


00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:24.975
Then it's our fault.


00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:27.138
You are idiots!


00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:28.944
What the hell did you say?


00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:31.212
Are you a fool??


00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.024
Stop! Don't do it!


00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:51.036
Don't move!


00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:59.011
That's enough.


00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:11.023
The money on the table is payment


00:03:11.157 --> 00:03:14.126
for my men's results.


00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:17.997
We won't invade your turf again.


00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.998
You have received a warning.


00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:25.971
Be careful where you do business.


00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:30.042
I don't want to run into you again.


00:04:05.044 --> 00:04:08.013
I am interested in childhood traumas.


00:05:29.095 --> 00:05:30.926
How much left?


00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:34.963
Twenty thousand.


00:05:35.001 --> 00:05:37.970
This is only the interest.
When will you pay every cent?


00:05:41.007 --> 00:05:43.032
Please sir, don't do this!


00:05:43.076 --> 00:05:45.943
I don't have the money


00:05:45.945 --> 00:05:46.969
to pay you now.


00:05:47.013 --> 00:05:49.982
I'll find a way to pay all of it back.


00:07:14.133 --> 00:07:16.966
So you're in love with him?


00:07:17.003 --> 00:07:18.197
It will be very difficult if you choose


00:07:18.204 --> 00:07:20.172
to do this again.


00:07:20.173 --> 00:07:22.164
There won't be a next time


00:07:22.208 --> 00:07:25.177
if I see you both together again.


00:07:34.053 --> 00:07:37.022
Remember what I said.


00:08:00.046 --> 00:08:02.981
You should go back to Japan


00:08:03.015 --> 00:08:05.984
and we won't see each other again


00:08:17.964 --> 00:08:20.933
I see.


00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:33.979
"CHOCOLATE"


00:09:12.985 --> 00:09:14.111
I've checked everything


00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:17.089
and I think she has problems
with her brain development.


00:09:37.009 --> 00:09:38.943
This doll is a reminder of my father.


00:09:38.945 --> 00:09:41.209
Look after it carefully.


00:09:59.966 --> 00:10:00.990
Your daughter's condition is not that bad.


00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.194
Zen's condition is stable


00:10:02.234 --> 00:10:05.032
but she will need special care


00:10:05.037 --> 00:10:06.004
so that she can be as normal as possible.


00:10:06.038 --> 00:10:09.007
Some things will not come easily to her.


00:10:35.001 --> 00:10:37.936
Although time has passed, you should know,


00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:40.939
there is a reason as to why I let you go that day.


00:10:42.975 --> 00:10:45.944
It is so difficult to look after
our daughter, but I am happy


00:10:46.979 --> 00:10:49.948
because when I see her, I see you.


00:10:51.083 --> 00:10:54.052
Zen is not like other kids.
She needs special care and attention.


00:10:56.956 --> 00:10:59.925
My life is devoted to her.
I will always love you... Zin.


00:11:03.162 --> 00:11:06.131
Zin and that Japanese are
contacting each other again.


00:11:07.133 --> 00:11:10.102
What should we do?


00:11:22.148 --> 00:11:24.048
Having fun playing by yourself?


00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:25.176
Zen!


00:11:25.217 --> 00:11:28.186
Let's chat, have a seat.


00:11:33.025 --> 00:11:35.084
You're Zen? Japanese name


00:11:35.127 --> 00:11:37.994
just like her father.


00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:39.156
Can you speak Thai?


00:11:39.198 --> 00:11:42.167
What do you want?


00:11:45.104 --> 00:11:46.128
Leave her alone!


00:11:46.138 --> 00:11:49.107
Sit down!


00:11:50.042 --> 00:11:51.976
You know what this is called?


00:11:52.011 --> 00:11:54.980
Hmmm?


00:11:56.015 --> 00:11:58.984
Do you know?


00:11:59.018 --> 00:12:01.987
I said leave her alone!


00:12:28.013 --> 00:12:30.072
Let me tell you,


00:12:30.082 --> 00:12:32.016
losing a toe can change


00:12:32.051 --> 00:12:35.020
your way of life...


00:12:35.988 --> 00:12:38.013
When you walk... when you run...


00:12:38.023 --> 00:12:39.149
you're constantly reminded


00:12:39.191 --> 00:12:41.989
of the past.


00:12:41.994 --> 00:12:44.963
I should have done this to you then.


00:12:45.965 --> 00:12:47.125
So you wouldn't have to be reminded


00:12:47.133 --> 00:12:50.034
of the pain


00:12:50.035 --> 00:12:53.004
every day.


00:13:23.969 --> 00:13:26.938
Actually this place is quite convenient.


00:13:26.972 --> 00:13:28.064
It can be a bit loud, but you'll get used to it.


00:15:54.186 --> 00:15:56.211
Owww!!


00:15:56.221 --> 00:15:59.190
It hurts!!


00:17:11.997 --> 00:17:14.966
Thank you, thank you, thank you...


00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:16.092
That was Zen performing


00:17:16.101 --> 00:17:17.966
Thank you for the applause...


00:17:18.003 --> 00:17:19.971
Thank you for the encouragement...


00:17:19.972 --> 00:17:20.961
Don't be shy...


00:17:21.006 --> 00:17:23.065
Check those pockets for coins...


00:17:23.075 --> 00:17:25.976
Thank you...


00:17:26.011 --> 00:17:26.978
Thanks very much...


00:17:27.012 --> 00:17:29.071
Any more Maam?


00:17:29.114 --> 00:17:32.083
Thank you, thank you, thank you everybody


00:17:32.217 --> 00:17:33.206
Thanks very much...


00:17:33.252 --> 00:17:36.153
Any more coins?


00:17:36.155 --> 00:17:37.144
Thank you...


00:17:37.156 --> 00:17:39.989
