00:18:16.028 --> 00:18:17.154
Oh, I thought she was really tough.


00:18:17.162 --> 00:18:20.029
What else can she do?


00:18:20.032 --> 00:18:21.090
Hothing...


00:18:21.133 --> 00:18:21.929
It's OK, let's go...


00:18:22.067 --> 00:18:23.091
It's OK, let's go...


00:18:23.102 --> 00:18:24.160
Hey, hey hey, where are you going?


00:18:24.169 --> 00:18:27.138
Hey, hey hey, where are you going?


00:18:28.073 --> 00:18:28.971
You're dead, fat man!


00:19:18.991 --> 00:19:21.960
Don't tell Zin about your leg, OK?


00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:23.118
Are you OK?


00:19:23.128 --> 00:19:24.186
