00:19:24.196 --> 00:19:27.063
Hot everything can be caught in your hands.


00:19:27.065 --> 00:19:29.932
Hot everything can be caught in your hands.


00:19:29.935 --> 00:19:31.027
Let's do this, if you cannot
catch it with your hands,


00:19:31.069 --> 00:19:33.003
Let's do this, if you cannot
catch it with your hands,


00:19:33.038 --> 00:19:35.063
I'll yell...


00:19:35.073 --> 00:19:35.971
I'll yell...


00:19:41.013 --> 00:19:43.072
They're all gone now... all gone.


00:19:43.115 --> 00:19:44.980
Let's do this. Hext time it's
dangerous, I will yell... Flies!


00:19:44.983 --> 00:19:46.177
Let's do this. Hext time it's
dangerous, I will yell... Flies!


00:19:46.218 --> 00:19:49.051
Let's do this. Hext time it's
dangerous, I will yell... Flies!


00:19:49.054 --> 00:19:52.023
