Go and look inside.


00:43:23.968 --> 00:43:26.937
Don't be afraid! Let's go home.


00:43:34.078 --> 00:43:35.136
Gotta get money...


00:43:35.145 --> 00:43:36.009
Come here


00:43:36.046 --> 00:43:37.980
mom's money...


00:43:37.982 --> 00:43:38.971
Sit down.


00:43:38.983 --> 00:43:39.950
Don't go.


00:43:39.984 --> 00:43:40.951
You'll only see the flies again.


00:43:40.985 --> 00:43:42.179
Ho! Gotta get mom's money!


00:43:42.219 --> 00:43:43.117
Take me back there now!


00:43:43.153 --> 00:43:45.178
What's all the noise?


00:43:45.189 --> 00:43:48.158
Hothing auntie.


00:44:53.991 --> 00:44:56.960
What did you say?


00:44:58.095 --> 00:45:00.188
It's been two weeks already
and still not finished?


00:45:00.230 --> 00:45:01.162
Stop the nonsense!


00:45:01.165 --> 00:45:02.132
Tell him if it's not ready tomorrow,


00:45:02.166 --> 00:45:05.135
he'll have the same fate as his brother.


00:45:06.136 --> 00:45:09.105
Hey, do you know what you're doing?


00:45:09.973 --> 00:45:12.942
Give it here. I'll show you.


00:45:38.001 --> 00:45:40.970
Zin's daughter?


00:45:43.140 --> 00:45:46.109
My mom's money!


00:45:57.054 --> 00:46:00.023
Get it if you can!


00:46:29.219 --> 00:46:32.188
Get them!


00:49:18.989 --> 00:49:21.958
Come down here and help! Hurry!


00:50:42.172 --> 00:50:44.970
Give me mom's money


00:50:44.975 --> 00:50:47.944
It's only 5,000, why do you have to do this?


00:50:52.182 --> 00:50:55.151
Take it!


00:51:34.191 --> 00:51:37.160
We have confirmed the chemotherapy.


00:51:38.161 --> 00:51:41.153
Oh, by the way, somebody left
this candy for your sister.


00:51:42.165 --> 00:51:44.133
The person was just here.


00:51:44.134 --> 00:51:45.123
Who was it?


00:51:45.168 --> 00:51:48.137
I don't remember.


00:52:05.088 --> 00:52:08.023
Here, someone left you a treat.


00:52:08.058 --> 00:52:09.047
Mom, can you come here?


00:52:17.000 --> 00:52:18.194
What did you guys do?
Why are you covered in bruises?


00:52:18.201 --> 00:52:20.169
Where did you get all the money?


00:52:20.203 --> 00:52:23.172
Uhhhmmm...


00:52:35.051 --> 00:52:38.020
How did this get here?


00:52:40.023 --> 00:52:42.150
What did you do?


00:52:42.192 --> 00:52:44.956
Hothing, I went to the hospital.


00:52:44.961 --> 00:52:47.953
I asked, who did you go to see?


00:52:48.198 --> 00:52:50.996
Hothing, I went to the hospital and...


00:52:51.001 --> 00:52:53.970
And what?!?


00:52:55.005 --> 00:52:55.937
Listen to me auntie!


00:52:55.972 --> 00:52:57.132
What's your excuse?


00:52:57.140 --> 00:52:57.970
I asked you to take care of Zen,
but what did you end up doing?


00:52:58.008 --> 00:53:00.977
I asked you to take care of Zen,
but what did you end up doing?


00:53:03.013 --> 00:53:04.981
What do you want me to do?


00:53:04.981 --> 00:53:06.073
I found your book with all the names
of people who owe you money.


00:53:06.082 --> 00:53:07.947
It's all your money, isn't it?


00:53:07.984 --> 00:53:09.952
However, I didn't know the full story.


00:53:09.986 --> 00:53:10.213
We don't have enough money
to pay for your medicine.


00:53:10.220 --> 00:53:13.189
It is so expensive.


00:53:13.990 --> 00:53:15.082
You're dying, and Zen is mentally handicapped.


00:53:17.060 --> 00:53:19.995
We need the money!


00:53:19.996 --> 00:53:22.965
What else are we to do?


00:53:25.202 --> 00:53:28.137
Who did you go and see?


00:53:28.138 --> 00:53:29.969
The people in the book.


00:53:30.006 --> 00:53:32.975
What's going on? Who are they?


00:53:33.076 --> 00:53:34.941
Did you have trouble with them?


00:53:34.945 --> 00:53:36.173
We need this money,


00:53:36.213 --> 00:53:39.182
it could save your life.


00:53:42.185 --> 00:53:44.119
Mom, can you do me a favour?


00:53:44.120 --> 00:53:46.918
Can you take a letter to Hishi San restaurant.


00:53:46.957 --> 00:53:49.221
Tell him it's extremely important.


00:53:52.195 --> 00:53:54.129
Thanks.


00:53:54.164 --> 00:53:55.995
Sorry to trouble you.


00:53:55.999 --> 00:53:57.967
I'll try to reach him.


00:53:58.001 --> 00:54:00.936
If I can reach him, I'll call you.


00:54:13.216 --> 00:54:14.183
Hang on!


00:54:48.184 --> 00:54:50.118
Zin is trying to send this letter to her husband.


00:54:50.120 --> 00:54:53.089
What should we do this time?


00:55:05.001 --> 00:55:06.161
Just send it. We can then
settle this once and for all.


00:55:06.169 --> 00:55:09.138
It looks like he may return to Thailand.


00:55:27.057 --> 00:55:30.026
I need to return to Thailand immediately.


00:55:37.133 --> 00:55:38.964
Hello?


00:55:39.002 --> 00:55:41.971
Yes...


00:55:43.006 --> 00:55:45.975
I understand.


00:55:46.209 --> 00:55:47.972
I'll be there immediately.


00:55:47.977 --> 00:55:50.946
See you there.


00:56:29.018 --> 00:56:31.077
Hello?


00:56:31.121 --> 00:56:34.090
I thought you said they were next door.


00:56:34.224 --> 00:56:37.193
I haven't seen a single soul!


00:56:38.027 --> 00:56:40.996
More silent than a cemetery.


00:56:40.997 --> 00:56:43.966
Wait for me there.


00:56:44.000 --> 00:56:46.127
OK, I'll be here.


00:56:46.136 --> 00:56:49.105
Just hurry.


00:56:49.205 --> 00:56:51.036
Oh... this is ruining my mood...


00:56:51.040 --> 00:56:54.009
Can you change the channel?
I don't like it.


00:57:17.066 --> 00:57:18.931
Ah...


00:57:18.935 --> 00:57:19.959
They already left before I got here.


00:57:20.003 --> 00:57:22.972
They're not here but they should still be alive.


00:57:23.072 --> 00:57:26.041
Ah...


00:57:26.109 --> 00:57:29.078
But the gang was here waiting for them.


00:57:29.979 --> 00:57:32.948
I'll try the store.


00:57:33.983 --> 00:57:35.951
Ah...


00:57:35.985 --> 00:57:38.954
I will go...


00:57:55.038 --> 00:57:58.007
It's me, remember?


00:59:26.229 --> 00:59:27.958
You know there's no escape.


00:59:27.997 --> 00:59:30.966
I am not afraid to kill him.


00:59:32.001 --> 00:59:33.195
Brother mom, where are you?


00:59:33.202 --> 00:59:35.102
Let's catch up.


00:59:35.138 --> 00:59:36.969
It's been a long time.


00:59:37.006 --> 00:59:39.975
We miss you here.


01:00:36.165 --> 01:00:38.065
Haven't seen you in a while.


01:00:38.101 --> 01:00:41.070
You look horrible.


01:00:43.239 --> 01:00:45.002
Give me back my brother.


01:00:45.008 --> 01:00:47.977
I want to go home.


01:00:50.113 --> 01:00:52.047
Wouldn't that be nice.


01:00:52.081 --> 01:00:54.982
If he cared for your kid at all,


01:00:54.984 --> 01:00:56.918
she wouldn't be going around


01:00:56.953 --> 01:00:57.920
robbing people.


01:00:57.954 --> 01:00:59.945
It's my money.


01:00:59.989 --> 01:01:01.081
It's our money. It's our business.


01:01:01.090 --> 01:01:03.058
It was our agreement.


01:01:03.092 --> 01:01:06.061
Hothing was ever yours.


01:01:07.964 --> 01:01:10.023
That all ended already.


01:01:10.033 --> 01:01:12.160
But it's not finished with me.


01:01:12.201 --> 01:01:15.170
Your kid went around beating up my guys.


01:01:16.072 --> 01:01:19.041
My people were killed by your husband.


01:01:19.042 --> 01:01:20.009
Then let's end it all here today.


01:01:26.215 --> 01:01:27.204
Mom... Where's mom?


01:01:27.216 --> 01:01:30.185
So you really want to see him?


01:01:32.221 --> 01:01:35.190
I can arrange that.


01:01:40.997 --> 01:01:44.956
Mom! Mom!


01:02:09.225 --> 01:02:10.157
If you hadn't gone with that Japanese,


01:02:10.193 --> 01:02:12.218
you wouldn't have ended up like this.


01:02:12.228 --> 01:02:15.925
How I'll have to kill you.


01:05:24.220 --> 01:05:25.187
Zen!


01:05:25.221 --> 01:05:28.019
Come here!


01:05:28.057 --> 01:05:28.989
Zen!


01:10:04.033 --> 01:10:05.125
You bastard!


01:10:05.134 --> 01:10:07.034
This is between us now.


01:10:07.069 --> 01:10:10.038
Just you and me.


01:10:13.008 --> 01:10:15.977
Great great!


01:10:15.978 --> 01:10:18.947
Come on!!


01:10:59.121 --> 01:11:04.058
Zen!


01:11:34.990 --> 01:11:41.225
Mom!!


01:11:41.230 --> 01:11:44.199
Mother...


01:13:43.218 --> 01:13:46.187
Stop it! Let Zen go!


01:13:53.929 --> 01:13:56.921
Flies!


01:19:58.960 --> 01:20:00.154
Mom!! Mom!! Mom!!


01:20:00.195 --> 01:20:03.164
Mom...


01:20:49.144 --> 01:20:50.907
In reality,


01:20:50.946 --> 01:20:53.107
any life


01:20:53.982 --> 01:20:57.941
can never be perfect.


01:20:58.053 --> 01:21:01.989
But I discovered that


01:21:02.157 --> 01:21:04.990
one thing can make things less imperfect,
one thing can bring life close to perfection.


01:21:05.026 --> 01:21:08.018
One thing can make things less imperfect,
one thing can bring life close to perfection.


01:21:08.196 --> 01:21:10.164
It is love.
We must find love.


01:21:10.198 --> 01:21:13.167
It is love.
We must find love.

